  "voice": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "text": "Wavvy Wallet just got better.",
      "start": 0.45,
      "duration": 2.24,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i1.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "text": "Here are six new updates, explained step by step.",
      "start": 3.14,
      "duration": 4.26,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i2.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "text": "You'll find them in the What's New popup, after you update.",
      "start": 8.55,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i3.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "text": "Let's start with number one.",
      "start": 13.22,
      "duration": 1.94,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i4.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1q",
      "text": "Do you save or borrow with KCB M-Pesa? Now those messages can go into Wavvy too.",
      "start": 16.53,
      "duration": 6.2,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1a",
      "text": "If you've allowed SMS access, there's nothing to do. Your KCB M-Pesa messages come in by themselves.",
      "start": 23.88,
      "duration": 7.36,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1n",
      "text": "You get a notification, and the payment is already in your list.",
      "start": 31.69,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1n.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1b",
      "text": "No SMS access? Tap Add Transaction, choose SMS, paste the message, and tap Next.",
      "start": 36.18,
      "duration": 7.1,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1c",
      "text": "Wavvy reads it. Tap Import, and it's saved.",
      "start": 43.73,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2q",
      "text": "Number two is for iPhone users with MTN MoMo.",
      "start": 47.96,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2a",
      "text": "You can now bring in your MoMo messages, and even your PDF statements.",
      "start": 53.67,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2b",
      "text": "Wavvy sorts them into the right categories for you.",
      "start": 59.16,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3q",
      "text": "Number three. Tagging simply means saying what a payment was for, like food, rent, or family.",
      "start": 63.35,
      "duration": 8.04,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3a",
      "text": "Tap any transaction that says, tap to tag.",
      "start": 72.54,
      "duration": 3.18,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3b",
      "text": "If your internet drops, the tag screen tells you straight away. Tagging needs internet, so just reconnect, and carry on.",
      "start": 76.17,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3c",
      "text": "Once you're back online, type what it was for, and pick a tag.",
      "start": 84.62,
      "duration": 4.5,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d",
      "text": "Done. The payment is now tagged.",
      "start": 89.57,
      "duration": 2.58,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3d.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4q",
      "text": "Number four. Every time you send money, there's a small fee. Do you know how much they add up to?",
      "start": 93.3,
      "duration": 6.94,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4a",
      "text": "Open Insights, and find Total Expenses.",
      "start": 101.39,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4b",
      "text": "Swipe that card to the left, and there are your transaction charges for the month.",
      "start": 105.0,
      "duration": 4.46,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5q",
      "text": "Number five. Never forget rent, internet, or Netflix again.",
      "start": 110.61,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5a",
      "text": "Open the menu. Then choose, Bill Reminders.",
      "start": 116.6,
      "duration": 3.58,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5b",
      "text": "Add the bill's name, the due date, and how often it repeats.",
      "start": 120.63,
      "duration": 3.98,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5c",
      "text": "Wavvy reminds you the day before, and on the day.",
      "start": 125.06,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5d",
      "text": "You choose which alerts you get in Settings, under Notifications.",
      "start": 128.71,
      "duration": 4.46,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5d.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c6q",
      "text": "And number six. Money in and money out are now easier to tell apart, and Rwandan francs are supported.",
      "start": 134.32,
      "duration": 8.26,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c6q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c6a",
      "text": "When you tag a payment, money going out shows a minus, and an up arrow.",
      "start": 143.73,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c6a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c6b",
      "text": "Money coming in shows a plus, and a down arrow.",
      "start": 148.74,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c6b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c6c",
      "text": "And when a new MTN MoMo payment comes in, the notification shows it in Rwandan francs.",
      "start": 153.27,
      "duration": 6.68,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c6c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "o1",
      "text": "That's what's new. Update Wavvy Wallet today, and know where your money is going.",
      "start": 161.1,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/o1.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    }
  ],
